Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 15:13:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ef_tests: an ethrex-blocktest binary that runs fixtures
 on their delivered access lists

ethrex-blocktest [--bal.sequential] FILE... feeds each block the block access list its fixture delivers, as engine_newPayload would, on the parallel path unless --bal.sequential is given, and prints one JSON verdict per fixture. The test harness passes no list, so the parallel path only ever ran on the list ethrex built itself.
